    "description": "Price improvement!  Seller will financing! Welcome to 556 Arlington Street, a charming duplex located in the desirable Glen Park area of San Francisco. This property offers an exceptional investment opportunity with two well-appointed units, each featuring 2 bedrooms and 1 bathroom. Zoned RH2, it allows for versatile usage options and provides excellent potential for rental income growth.\n\nThe property currently has one unit occupied at $2,230 per month, delivering an immediate income stream, while the other unit is vacantideal for an owner-occupant looking to live in one unit and rent the other. Each unit is separately metered for gas and electricity, ensuring easy utility management for tenants. The vacant unit includes a private garage, adding valuable off-street parking in this bustling area.\n\nSet in a vibrant neighborhood, this property boasts convenient access to downtown San Francisco, the Peninsula, and nearby public transportation. With strong potential for future appreciation and positioned in a thriving rental market, 556 Arlington Street is perfect for investors and owner-occupants alike."
